{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "35038f22dab6e943c7fdee98627f3f03070157fdbc2c77acc42e849405313125", "ja": "いやっほぉぉぉ！！　海だー！\n海だよ、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "哇啊喔喔喔喔！！是海──！\n是海耶，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "74ac91fc04cf82b38db874ae3053e0d9c78ded34ec8ee7868ebcfb59fa84d964", "ja": "山ひとつ超えたところに、こんな穴場があったとは……\n麗花、よく知ってたな。", "zh": "越过一座山之后竟然有这种好地方……\n丽花，真亏你知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ac2a62dab7ca526201164acf946e233738b59fccdbbe0169b133d51ac6a45c7", "ja": "前に、登山で来たときに見つけたんですよ～。\nエッヘン！", "zh": "这是之前来登山的时候找到的喔～\n哼哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "7379012e8c0d5dc48f28837be463d7fce880a3c02a58d78ec39ef99161c742b3", "ja": "本当に、綺麗な海ですね！　こんな素敵なところに\nみなさんと来られて、わたし、とってもうれしいです♪", "zh": "真是漂亮的海呢！能和大家一起来到\n这么美妙的地方，我好开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "029f499e72ce48641ebe56740319bef7f93c169f246a38e654184b51f0e21dd6", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　今日は、\nわたし達のライブが成功した、ごほうびなんですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n今天是要犒赏我们让公演成功对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3bec497d9a0fdcc49392d8e4ed87d49bf36d8eb7d734ab0035ddda4dcf66b85d", "ja": "そうだよ、今日はクレシェンドブルーの\n打ち上げだからな。思いっきり羽を伸ばすといい！", "zh": "没错，今天是「Crescendo Blue」的庆功宴，\n大家就玩个够吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "ce4b0da15a53a892d7321bd01f2f9385efc49c6f4abd21160488e8be1ea505b8", "ja": "はいっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "好的，非常感谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "65a1c03cb8889f6221ca58ca037289187ded0e506da14644069caca1a12e1dc8", "ja": "さて、俺はバーベキューの準備をするとして……\nみんなは、先に海で遊んで来たらどうだ？", "zh": "好了，我先来准备烤肉……\n大家要不要先去海边玩水？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "3eb078e610640b45779306be19812eec8cd651a8a2437fd133a44230cede7c47", "ja": "さすが{$P$}ちゃん、気がきくね！\nそれじゃ茜ちゃんは、遠慮なく……。", "zh": "不愧是小{$P$}，真是周到！\n那小茜就不客气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce7967039e9dde837753e8e51bd249f76410b2466b8e3a90a12028b0f819bf26", "ja": "さあさあ、水をかけられたいみんな、かかってこ～い！\n茜ちゃんはテンションMAX！　記録更新中だよ！", "zh": "来吧来吧，想被泼水的大家，放马过来～！\n小茜心情嗨到极点！正在更新纪录唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "76fd58de65b05efce2ca111fdd1b1679954f8b6f7744c69f3e07560507665427", "ja": "わぁ、茜ちゃん元気だね♪\nそれじゃ、いくよー！　えいっ、えいっ！！", "zh": "哇，小茜真有活力呢♪\n那我就上啰──！嘿、嘿！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "f9b74bd20bb195560ec6b05e4bb19367f33ff675a44dee3c13a77b2c4e8f1178", "ja": "いや麗花ちゃん、いきなり飛び道具はダメじゃない！？\n……って、いやいや、バケツはもっとダメだってー！", "zh": "不不，小丽花，不能突然拿出水枪吧！？\n……等等，不不不，水桶更犯规啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "e176f8ea5dddb0046ac8053fc79afac8f63bb787905d2402c4ce76d49bd98997", "ja": "荷物はここでよしっ、と……。\n志保、ふくらませるの手伝って。", "zh": "行李就放在这里……\n志保，帮我充气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "2e999e87dde9b5ffd6b0b20a0120b4a36009eab5a1b920548e5caedcaef19e23", "ja": "……ビーチボール？\nまさか静香、それで遊ぶつもりなの？", "zh": "……海滩球？\n静香，你该不会打算玩那个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "f706b1d8c3fda825843864761f413d9d69dcbbb49f5f4d0a6eb3127afc0bfc60", "ja": "そうだけど。\nだって、浜辺と言ったらビーチバレーでしょ。", "zh": "是啊，\n因为说到海边就会想到沙滩排球吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a3208e9992aef7aaadb1e5db0749034789b7191d9797cf8f5e75c4223ffcc46", "ja": "前から少し思ってたけど……静香。\nあなた、ちょっと子どもっぽいんじゃない？", "zh": "我之前就有点感觉了……静香，\n你是不是有点幼稚呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "9dfc4e0cf604b34f31d1974be4af19da68c46fecc4cf00fdfa3aabbd24427676", "ja": "なっ……だ、誰が、子供っぽいですって！？", "zh": "什……你、你说谁幼稚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "45c4ea8f38705cc311951af8a778529a82c6bb0d44783e39d4811af2ca1c489c", "ja": "そうやって、すぐムキになるところとか。", "zh": "就像这样一下子就气呼呼之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f2e8782978cfd4c05124220dff6a784aec555134c306072a7dad73279d8ce69", "ja": "む、ムキになってなんか……わかった。\nもしかして志保、ビーチバレー苦手なんじゃない？", "zh": "我、我才没有气呼呼……我知道了，\n志保，我看你是不会打沙滩排球吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "77fa2e90f5d4e87430145271e36f367058ed6f8d00e5fd032b4c5efd24fc8c63", "ja": "別に。", "zh": "并没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0877e3fbafa10dd8b382fc0894170606cdb582ed51b20dbbfad80bef2bec20f", "ja": "本当？", "zh": "真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "6734db4730574988eacc6e69348a06143a66d59666461f2ddcb2513aaa987458", "ja": "……確かめてみる？", "zh": "……你要试试看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "e0d7ab25054ce318147a36b6435fdbdb3e27d4dc2ab93e06b94f58eef286e619", "ja": "ふふっ。静香さん達、とっても仲良くなりましたね。\n楽しそうです！", "zh": "呵呵，静香姊姊她们感情变得很好了呢，\n看起来真开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "8be17ffeb7c57520b4a7022f1b1664b2679ccbcf1655ae5b84f60b0ab160f46b", "ja": "そ、そうかなー？\n茜ちゃん、目から火花出てるのが見えたけどなー？", "zh": "是、是这样吗──？\n小茜倒是看到她们眼睛里冒出火花了呢──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e81ff8a3312fcaff3901cb96063f584b9eb4e3b5ca7d2124f2ff24b19386c1f", "ja": "えっ！　くすん、見逃しちゃった……。\nもう一回出してくれないかな？", "zh": "咦！呜，漏看了……\n不知道能不能再冒一次呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "0612ce58ab790fe85b785e35e829f43352b5e7cbfd2d2e1ee36bce17f9599368", "ja": "うーん、目には見えないと思うな―！\n宇宙人ならビームくらい出るかもだけど！", "zh": "唔──肉眼应该是看不到吧──！\n如果是外星人应该会发射光线之类的就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "46cb497f6493ac21c645afeab11e8023675437c5832513839669e4006721cc25", "ja": "茜ちゃんの目力が高まると、ナデナデして光線が\n出るよ！　ねっ、{$P$}ちゃん♪", "zh": "小茜眼神的魄力提高之后，摸摸头就会\n发出光线喔！对不对，小{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "93aee76e88af7ad062841684244f8cf461eb1702c5b91089597bc3a1d93a9960", "ja": "そうなんだ？　茜ちゃん、すごいね！\n私にもその目、ちょっと貸してほしいな～。", "zh": "是这样喔？小茜真厉害！\n那对眼睛可以借我一下吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "d8c5180b72dcd642b326702d434a0a9229861a3980b83173d11980eabf1c6742", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、茜ちゃんの目はアタッチメント式じゃ\nないからね！　取ろうとするのやめてね！", "zh": "小丽花，小茜的眼睛可不是拆卸式的喔！\n别试着拆下来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "9b44a8650887864d9d645c4645eff61c68a4984c1b0b8b05a68d5459a88ef73d", "ja": "あっ、星梨花。茜さん、麗花さんも。\nこっちで一緒に、ビーチバレーしませんか？", "zh": "啊，星梨花，还有小茜和丽花姊，\n要不要一起在这边打沙滩排球？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "fbaf8341cba63e185f199a8cf19a7124c52064f3b4f9d8fad418620c945b49b1", "ja": "あっ、やりたいです！\nえっと……どっちのチームに入ったらいいですか？", "zh": "啊，我想打！\n可是……要加入哪边的队伍呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "4e43eed462a4b7db11ef2e1437cabd540650edf6151a2fe715fd25abbc25c1e0", "ja": "別に、好きな方でいいんじゃない？", "zh": "选喜欢的就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ce7b96e71b4210df8c25974702894a889d31ef7cef64a80f0eb59832d55f08f", "ja": "ええっ、そんな……わたし、決められません！\nおふたりとも、大好きですから……。", "zh": "咦咦，怎么这样……我没办法决定！\n两个人我都好喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "de81151a4f85f60285bdba277f5c1b43811da6dde06ff0886ad5af4571c36797", "ja": "せ、星梨花……。", "zh": "星、星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "9ca5c91cb4a6e2e3b5bd0b61c77154286b63181aa277a1e19343d66bda0c6aae", "ja": "……別に、好きってそういう意味じゃ\nないんだけど……。", "zh": "……其实喜欢也不是\n那个意思啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "4f1077be67c9e91a06ad7b7d29db205e8a8a798df10bde9b3b12941a644dd8dc", "ja": "そこで愛されキャラ茜ちゃん登場ー！　さあさあ、\n茜ちゃんのことも取り合っていいんだよ！　ホラホラ！", "zh": "万人迷小茜在此登场──！快来快来，\n你们可以争夺小茜喔！来吧来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "5abc1351838862eaf64b532d75530b5439e717dcb39bf575d462a082eca2fb81", "ja": "あっ、じゃあ私、審判やりまーす♪", "zh": "啊，那我来当裁判──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "a415400f8ce3b296343871dc4e9d0232e0c710e05fbaae22e2b0bd27120bf5df", "ja": "トリプルボギーが20点、スーアンコウが60点、\nロイヤルストレートフラッシュが100点だよ♪", "zh": "三柏忌是20分，四暗刻是60分，\n同花大顺是100分喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "45bb12fe287d5dcaf7a5a802758e4c9ba119711242aa3f2be3e374b806be6e97", "ja": "えーっと……あれ？\n麗花さん、ビーチバレーの話してます……？", "zh": "呃……奇怪？\n丽花姊，你是在说沙滩排球吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "3b1d7e5cd3181d3ced901396da98393658b4fb07a228c82f062fe539758c9668", "ja": "なんだか、もうめちゃくちゃ。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "总觉得已经乱成一团了。\n……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "8bdfef0979ab46c3ddff323884a0518b65aa77c72b84032f86128cbba642bb7a", "ja": "よかった。志保も充分、楽しめてるみたいだな。\nなら、もう……今さら必要ないか？", "zh": "太好了，看来志保也十分乐在其中呢。\n那事到如今……已经不需要了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "34988571391c8aea0f7481924b417bbf255614c29b94bbe964ef2bec8a969da4", "ja": "……？\n{$P$}さん、どういう意味ですか？", "zh": "……？\n{$P$}先生，那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "e85a10df2a4a68e598601951cac7b1e9b5395a00648c11718932d25429c843e0", "ja": "いや、志保の顔を見て思い出したんだけど……。\n今朝、志保のお母さんから電話があったんだ。", "zh": "没什么，我看到志保的脸才想起来……\n今天早上我接到志保妈妈的电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "b005a5cc9453d5601e6005e992c1a8d38452ef535ded01cb1ffaa487ed8bf8a1", "ja": "えっ！？　は、母から？　どうして……。", "zh": "咦！？家、家母打来？为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "2794d8af7dadcfb83cceba7fa65d4404d80a52ca6ba5b61e283c3fb59ea8b86a", "ja": "今日一日、志保をよろしくお願いしますって。\nそうそう、弟さんも電話に出てきてくれてな。", "zh": "她说今天志保就麻烦我照顾了，\n对了，你弟弟也接了电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1046_p", "source_sha256": "04b9ab6f46875394d11563ae0d18106c6d1a1db787db24d000b68028f00437ad", "ja": "お姉ちゃんに、たくさん楽しんできてねって\n伝えてください、って言われたんだよ。", "zh": "他请我转告姊姊，\n说要玩得开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "553ff30de050b7c2e4e0046fd429e4c645a591f4f1b28b0da1b6a5c5da007939", "ja": "な……ど、どうしてそういうことを、\n今言うんですか！？", "zh": "什……为、为什么你现在才\n说这些事呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "171fa0d250a0fe8382d37895f62b46651af62c35e5bc7607cea3a8abf174db94", "ja": "その、朝はバタバタしてたから、つい伝え忘れて……。\nごめん、悪かった！", "zh": "那个，因为早上匆匆忙忙的，不小心就忘了……\n抱歉，是我不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "b890fc3af29132a2848c4d83742424e2e19eb84e75d4032ae044344571186a38", "ja": "……はあ。もういいです。", "zh": "……唉，算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "bff7116b28a7d4dcceaf93a6126b06265fadcac2076688fa5730a62568f69eae", "ja": "それより、早くお昼にしましょう。\nバーベキューが焦げますから。", "zh": "别管这个了，我们快吃午餐吧。\n肉都快烤焦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "6f65cb264e2479d01bd573b7fcbc3bf919f89f19a3c10dee8513dc2b81f8e3f0", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nおーい、みんな！　お昼にするぞー！", "zh": "啊，对喔。\n喂──各位！吃午餐了喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1052_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1053_022ser", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1054_023aka", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1055_048rei", "source_sha256": "290feee14b9abf39314805ee0a6bf5f801170b44d7a600794b8ecf5ea4f1a2db", "ja": "はーいっ♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1056_p", "source_sha256": "65ca78903d09c1900dae80091427200c36e6a014d384872790794584186ff7fb", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルーは、衝突やすれ違いを\n乗り越えたからこそ、最高のユニットになった）", "zh": "（正因为克服了冲突和误会，\n「Crescendo Blue」才能成为最棒的团体。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_1057_p", "source_sha256": "f06333c41bc0c61a3241eb964e83850b221356f9a9e509b97f9ea7ff82185bae", "ja": "（ユニット活動はひと段落だが、今回の経験で\nみんな大きく成長した。これからが楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（虽然团体活动告了一段落，但有了这次经验，\n大家都有很大的成长，令人期待接下来的发展呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f421eb2c2c55fc02cea6a0c2455cf838e1064cc266541b56451700f83e221300", "ja": "たどりついた景色", "zh": "终于看见的景色", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "305a88a84f00d35360d1c63f4fd4167a72f83e7b1c1720695ccc4d95678b0722", "ja": "公演が成功したご褒美で、プロデューサーに\n海に連れてきてもらったクレシェンドブルー\nのメンバーたち。衝突やすれ違いを乗り越え\nた彼女たちは、仲良く無邪気に水遊びを楽し\nむのだった。", "zh": "为了犒赏「Crescendo Blue」顺利完成公演，\n制作人带领成员们来到海边。在克服冲突和\n误会之后，她们纯真和乐地一起享受\n玩水的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
